+// ── 7. shelving-feasibility-readers (1344-A §3.6, §6.7) ─────────────────────────
+// Sub-clause (c), "authorRivalPromise excludes shelved screenplays from its project
+// candidates", is NOT independently exercised in this file: `authorRivalPromise` is
+// private to talentMarket.ts, and two exploratory probes (recorded in the handback)
+// found 0 rival SPECIFIC_PROJECT promises in 80 weeks from genesis and 0 in the week
+// 130-230 renewal window on r01 — the only two SPECIFIC_PROJECT-reachable candidates
+// (director/cast count families) resolve first every time this route was sampled, so
+// no reliable, non-vacuous natural trigger was found inside a reasonable bound. This
+// is reported as a finding in 1344-C-shelving-red-handback.md, not silently dropped.
+describe('shelving-feasibility-readers (1344-A §3.6)', () => {
